<footer class="ftr">
  <div class="wrap ftr__in">
    <div class="ftr__brand">
      <img src="/logo.svg" alt="Heirloom" width="112" height="20" />
      <p>Know what you own. A home inventory for the things that matter, and a reference for reading the marks on them.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/id6754576251">Get Heirloom for iPhone</a>
    </div>
    <nav class="ftr__cols" aria-label="Footer">
      <div>
        <h2><a href="/app">The app</a></h2>
        <a href="/app">How Heirloom works</a>
        <a href="/home-inventory-app">Home inventory app</a>
        <a href="/family-heirlooms">Family heirlooms</a>
        <a href="/antique-identifier-app">For collectors</a>
        <a href="https://web.heirloomapp.io">Sign in on the web</a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2><a href="/marks/">Reference</a></h2>
        <a href="/marks/">Marks</a>
        <a href="/signatures">Signatures</a>
        <a href="/marks/london-date-letters">British date letters</a>
        <a href="/marks/silver-marks">Silver marks</a>
        <a href="/marks/gold-marks">Gold marks</a>
        <a href="/marks/watch-serial-numbers">Watch serial numbers</a>
        <a href="/marks/pottery-marks">Pottery and porcelain marks</a>
        <a href="/marks/pottery-date-codes">Pottery date codes</a>
        <a href="/marks/chinese-reign-marks">Chinese reign marks</a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2><a href="/guides">Guides</a></h2>
        <a href="/home-inventory-checklist">Home inventory checklist</a>
        <a href="/silver-hallmarks">Silver hallmarks</a>
        <a href="/marks/is-it-real-silver">Is it real silver?</a>
        <a href="/guides">All guides</a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2><a href="/">Heirloom</a></h2>
        <a href="/support">Support</a>
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
        <a href="/terms">Terms</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap ftr__base">
    <p class="ftr__note">Value estimates are informational only and are not professional appraisals. Many items have no market value, and a record is complete without one. Specialists, sale conversations, sold prices and Heirloom’s price estimates are offered in the United States only for now.</p>
    <!-- The company's name and year sit between pc: markers that the legal sync
         in joe-at-heirloom/thepeninsularcompany.github.io keeps current. -->
    <p class="label">© <Fragment set:html={'<!--pc:year-->2026<!--/pc:year-->'} /> <a href="https://thepeninsularcompany.com"><Fragment set:html={'<!--pc:name-->The Peninsular Company, LLC<!--/pc:name-->'} /></a>. All rights reserved.</p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .ftr { margin-top: clamp(80px, 10vw, 140px); border-top: 3px solid var(--accent); background: var(--paper-2); }
  .ftr__in { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 2.4fr; gap: 48px; padding-block: 56px 36px; }
  .ftr__brand img { height: 20px; width: auto; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .ftr__brand p { max-width: 34ch; font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink-2); margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .ftr__cols { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 24px; }
  .ftr__cols h2 { font: 500 13px/1.4 var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .ftr__cols h2 a { display: inline; padding: 0; font: inherit; color: var(--accent-ink); }
  .ftr__cols h2 a:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .ftr__cols a { display: block; padding: 5px 0; font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; }
  .ftr__cols a:hover { color: var(--accent-ink); }
  .ftr__base { padding-block: 0 32px; display: grid; gap: 10px; }
  .ftr__note { margin: 0; max-width: 92ch; font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .ftr__base a { color: inherit; }
  @media (max-width: 1000px) { .ftr__in { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .ftr__in { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .ftr__cols { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
</style>
